MaxMind GeoLite

This product includes GeoLite data created by MaxMind, available from
https://www.maxmind.com

The geographic data used by CatWAF is derived from MaxMind's GeoLite
databases and is redistributed within the geoip-lite npm package, which
CatWAF installs as a dependency. CatWAF does not itself redistribute the
GeoLite data files, and does not claim any ownership of them. MaxMind's
own licence terms govern that data; see
https://www.maxmind.com/en/geolite2/eula

Note that the data shipped with geoip-lite is a point-in-time snapshot and
is not the current GeoLite release. See the geoip-lite documentation for how
to refresh it. CatWAF reports a location only where the database has one —
addresses with no entry, and all private, loopback and reserved addresses,
are recorded and displayed as having no known location rather than being
given approximate coordinates.

